cmu-trait-fear-of-heights-name = Fear of Heights
cmu-trait-fear-of-heights-desc = Getting within a couple of steps of a drop more than one story down makes your head spin.
cmu-fear-of-heights-scared-1 = Your stomach drops as you see how far down it goes. You feel dizzy.
cmu-fear-of-heights-scared-2 = The ground below seems to tilt and sway. You need to get away from the edge.
cmu-fear-of-heights-scared-3 = Your legs go weak looking over the drop.
cmu-fear-of-heights-scared-4 = Don't look down. Don't look down.
cmu-fear-of-heights-calm = You back away from the edge and your head starts to clear.

cmu-trait-fear-of-water-name = Fear of Water
cmu-trait-fear-of-water-desc = Being in water, even shallow water, makes your head spin.
cmu-fear-of-water-scared-1 = The water closes around your legs and your heart starts pounding.
cmu-fear-of-water-scared-2 = You can't stop thinking about what might be under the surface. You feel dizzy.
cmu-fear-of-water-scared-3 = Your breathing quickens. You need to get out of the water.
cmu-fear-of-water-calm = You step out of the water and your nerves start to settle.

cmu-trait-cant-swim-name = Can't Swim
cmu-trait-cant-swim-desc = You never learned to swim. You struggle through water, and water over your head will drown you in seconds.
cmu-cant-swim-shallow = You wade in carefully, keeping your footing.
cmu-cant-swim-deep = The water's over your head! You can't swim!
cmu-cant-swim-going-under = You're going under!
cmu-cant-swim-out = You drag yourself out of the deep water, coughing and spluttering.
cmu-cant-swim-drowning-self-1 = You thrash at the water, swallowing mouthfuls of it!
cmu-cant-swim-drowning-self-2 = You can't keep your head above the water!
cmu-cant-swim-drowning-self-3 = Water floods your lungs as you sink!
cmu-cant-swim-drowning-others-1 = { CAPITALIZE(THE($target)) } flails wildly in the water!
cmu-cant-swim-drowning-others-2 = { CAPITALIZE(THE($target)) } is struggling to keep { POSS-ADJ($target) } head above the water!
cmu-cant-swim-drowning-others-3 = { CAPITALIZE(THE($target)) } is drowning!

cmu-trait-clumsy-name = Clumsy
cmu-trait-clumsy-desc = Every now and then your hands just don't cooperate, and you fumble whatever you were doing.
cmu-clumsy-fumble-1 = Your hands slip and you fumble it.
cmu-clumsy-fumble-2 = You lose your grip and have to start over.
cmu-clumsy-fumble-3 = Butterfingers. You fumble what you were doing.
cmu-clumsy-fumble-4 = You get your hands tangled up and lose your place.

cmu-trait-heavy-sleeper-name = Heavy Sleeper
cmu-trait-heavy-sleeper-desc = Once you're out, you're out. It takes a few good shakes, or a harder hit, to wake you.
cmu-heavy-sleeper-stirs = { CAPITALIZE(THE($target)) } stirs, but keeps sleeping.

cmu-trait-slow-thinking-name = Slow Thinking
cmu-trait-slow-thinking-desc = You take a moment to find your words, and the odd "um..." slips out.

cmu-trait-mute-name = Mute
cmu-trait-mute-desc = You can't speak. Only ordinary colonists can take this.
cmu-mute-cant-speak = You can't speak.

cmu-no-shake-when-resting = { CAPITALIZE(THE($target)) } doesn't seem to be getting up.
